<li id="S2.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(4)</span> 
<div id="S2.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.I2.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">If </span><math id="S2.I2.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m\geq 2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m\geq 2</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S2.I2.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> and </span><math id="S2.I2.i4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n\geq 4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n\geq 4</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S2.I2.i4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">, then</span></p>
<table id="S2.Ex20" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S2.Ex20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\int_{M}|A|^{2}\left(\frac{1}{3}|A|^{2}+2\hat{\mu}+\check{\kappa}-\check{\lambda}\right)dV_{M}\geq 0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>M</mi></msub><mrow><msup><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>κ</mi><mo>ˇ</mo></mover></mrow><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>λ</mi><mo>ˇ</mo></mover></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\int_{M}|A|^{2}\left(\frac{1}{3}|A|^{2}+2\hat{\mu}+\check{\kappa}-\check{\lambda}\right)dV_{M}\geq 0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S2.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p">In <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib33" title="" class="ltx_ref">33</a>]</cite>, the equality conditions for the above integral inequalities were characterized clearly.
Here we omit these equality conditions due to the complicated discussion.</p>
</div>
