<p id="S3.Thmthm11.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.Thmthm11.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The equality in (<a href="#S3.E1" title="In Theorem 3.11 (Lu inequality []). ‣ 3.4. Lu inequality ‣ 3. New progress on DDVV-type inequalities ‣ A survey on the DDVV-type inequalities" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a>) holds if and only if, after an orthonormal base change and up to a sign, we have</span></p>
